# Density Compare
# Polonium (Po) — real density 9.2 g/cm³. equal masses: Polonium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Polonium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 9.5mm color: #d8004d at (-20mm, 4.8mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 73.4 g — the water cube is the reference
